# Mandatory Engineering System Rule

This repository is the canonical Data Relay Labs Engineering System.

Before planning, editing, refactoring, fixing, testing, or releasing:

1. Read @AGENTS.md.
2. Read @.engineering/project.yaml.
3. Read @.engineering/tests.yaml.
4. Read @.engineering/release.yaml for release-related work.
5. Read the relevant file under @standards/.
6. Identify the change class and affected domains before implementation.
7. Make the smallest correct change and avoid enterprise-process expansion without demonstrated solo-developer value.
8. Validate schemas, templates, and reusable workflows after changes.
9. Never weaken validation merely to obtain PASS.
10. Never report unexecuted or blocked validation as PASS.
